     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell["\<\
PlotTheme is an option for plotting and related functions that specifies an \
overall theme for visualization elements and styles. \
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"8efddd19-2d58-4569-9d4b-d8ba96dcaf3c"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
