Properties is an option that allows specification of properties to objects \
and items of objects.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"5efe479e-7584-40dd-8ec4-de8199ef46c2"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
